	(descr "Hirose U.FL-R-SMT-1 (J1). Lands unchanged at the Hirose 'Recommended PCB Mounting Pattern' (catalogue 2014.10e p3: GND lands 4.0 outside / 1.9 inside / 2.2 high, SIG 1.0 x 1.05 with its top edge 1.0 below the mating axis); F.Cu no-trace rule area kept. D109: courtyard only, tightened from the 4.20 x 3.80 rectangle to the rectilinear union of the body (3.0 over the GND terminals x 3.1 over the SIG tabs) and the lands, each + 0.10. Derived from lib:U.FL_Hirose_U.FL-R-SMT-1_Vertical (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/U.FL_Hirose_U.FL-R-SMT-1_Vertical_L.json")
